{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-025.md","record_count":33,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"ராணி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தேங்க்ஸ்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மென்ஷன்...நோமென்ஷன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"ராஜ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சாந்தம்மா! சமரசம் வீடுல்ல இது? அய்யய்யோ. என்னா பண்ணுறது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"திருடன் பிடி, உடாதே.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சார்...சார்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடே ராஜா. ராஜா,","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சார்...சார்...அய்யய்யோ.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய், முருகா, சங்கரா. எல்லாம் வாங்கடா. டேய் பாபு...மச்சான். ஏ...மைத்துனரே....புடி உடாதே.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன? என்ன இங்கே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உடி புடாதே.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன...என்ன?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அங்க...அங்க...டேய், இங்கே யாராவது ஓடுறதை பாத்தீங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாக்கலீங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாக்கலல்ல...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பாக்கல.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சரி, போயி படுத்துக்குங்க. அங்கே...பின்னாலே சமையல் கட்டுக்கு போயிடணும். போங்க, உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னத்தான், என்ன நடந்தது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்--அந்த ராஜாவை நீ வரச்சொன்னியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":42,"printed_page":41}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ராஜாவையா? சொல்லலியே. ஏன்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சொல்லலீயே?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சொல்லலீயே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வந்துட்டானே...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எங்கே...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இங்க வந்துட்டான்...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எப்போ?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மெத்தையிலேயிருந்து ஓடி வந்தான்--நான் பாத்தேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கண்ணுல பாத்தேன்! அவனை உடப்படாது.... மச்சான் போச்சி; போச்சி... நீ போயி அவனை புடிச்சி கொண்டுபோடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கொண்ணு புடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான், பாத்துக்கிட்டே இருங்க...இன்னிக்கி முடிவுதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மச்சான்...ஆ...சமாதானம். சமாதானத்தோடேயே கொல்லு. புடிச்சி கொண்டா எங்கிட்ட ஆ...பாவி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s025-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s025","scene_ordinal":25,"transition_audit_id":"T025","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இது என்னா? ஜாக்கெட்டு! புடவை! ஆ, இது நான் வாங்கிக் கொடுக்கலியே! எப்படி இது வந்தது? ஆ...உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":43,"printed_page":42}],"source_scene_file":"scene-025.md"}]}
